{"recordId":"minister_永琪_2004053452","name":"永琪","type":"minister","dynasty":"清朝","title":"潛龍折翼","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"永琪","pageId":943114,"revisionId":93984203,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-21T14:20:55Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E7%90%AA","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93984203","wikidataId":"Q1021962","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"熱河日記","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"乾隆帝起居注22","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大清高宗純皇帝實錄","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"國朝宮史續編.卷一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"題為和碩榮純親王福晉病故請按例賜恤事","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"題為追封榮郡王綿億生母索綽絡氏為榮純親王側福晉照例賜恤事","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"阿哥使女丧仪用银","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:03.263Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:qingshigao"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-1aa749342ff81845","query":"永琪","count":2,"offset":3264,"excerpt":"六年封奉恩將軍，光緒二十七年卒〕\n溥泉〔載藹第一子。光緒二十八年襲奉恩將軍〕\n\n永琪〔高宗第五子。乾隆三十年封榮親王，三十一年薨，諡曰純〕\n綿億〔永琪第五子。乾隆四十九年封貝勒，嘉慶四年晉榮郡王，二十年薨，諡曰恪〕\n奕繪〔綿億第一子。嘉慶二十年","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-f5ba60768b5d089f","query":"永琪","count":1,"offset":11919,"excerpt":"者：\n*忻貴妃，戴佳氏，總督那蘇圖女。女二，皆殤。\n*愉貴妃，珂裡葉特氏。子一，永琪。\n*舒妃，葉赫那拉氏。子一，殤，未命名。\n*惇妃，汪氏。嘗笞宮婢死，上命降為嬪。未幾，復封。女一，下嫁豐紳殷德。\n*又有容妃，和卓氏，回部台吉和札賚女。初入宮","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-bd5e77fc9eaf18ca","query":"永琪","count":4,"offset":170,"excerpt":"氏生履端親王永珹、儀慎親王永璇、第九子、成哲親王永瑆，愉貴妃珂里葉特氏生榮純親王永琪，舒妃葉赫納喇氏生第十子。永珹出為履懿親王允祹後，永瑢出為慎靖郡王允禧後。永璟、永璐、第九子、第十子、第十六子皆殤，無封。\n\n定安親王永璜\n\n定安親王永璜，高宗","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:qingshigao-1aa749342ff81845","bookId":"book:qingshigao","requestedTitle":"清史稿/卷165","title":"清史稿/卷165","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E5%8F%B2%E7%A8%BF%2F%E5%8D%B7165","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2334099","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E5%8F%B2%E7%A8%BF%2F%E5%8D%B7165?action=history","revisionId":2334099,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-11-22T03:12:06Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T11:00:08.784Z","sha256":"06c48e272a389489cc9abdf65ba70a743a61cdaf1182f92b1f8d9ea63699811a","textSha256":"c5b5961670b0bd7cc12a268531fca0c266319a66582579bd0940bd084817dd4e","expandedWikitextSha256":"06c48e272a389489cc9abdf65ba70a743a61cdaf1182f92b1f8d9ea63699811a","characters":7767,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/qingshigao.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:49.570Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。","存在未知模板，保留原標記；尚未確認其呈現的全部內容。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclu